1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 25]</font>

15
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did you manage</font>

16
00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:32,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to quietly</font>

17
00:01:33,260 --> 00:01:34,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">give my parents a proper burial?</font>

18
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:37,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five years ago,</font>

19
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:39,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to the mass burial mound
in secret.</font>

20
00:01:40,460 --> 00:01:41,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I couldn't find your brother.</font>

21
00:01:43,020 --> 00:01:44,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only your parents' remains were found.</font>

22
00:01:45,580 --> 00:01:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I brought them back.</font>

23
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:49,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To keep it hidden,</font>

24
00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:51,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I named the tomb the Nameless</font>

25
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:53,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and assigned guards to watch over it.</font>

26
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Days ago, His Majesty
pardoned your family,</font>

27
00:02:00,580 --> 00:02:02,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I had the headstone recarved.</font>

28
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:04,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

29
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:14,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

30
00:02:14,740 --> 00:02:15,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

31
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need for thanks between us.</font>

32
00:02:19,580 --> 00:02:21,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your parents were my elders too.</font>

33
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:23,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the Bridge of Helplessness
truly exists,</font>

34
00:02:25,140 --> 00:02:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope they and my parents</font>

35
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:27,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can set aside old grudges</font>

36
00:02:28,700 --> 00:02:29,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and keep each other company.</font>

37
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:52,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's she saying for so long?</font>

38
00:02:53,580 --> 00:02:54,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps she's complaining about us</font>

39
00:02:55,080 --> 00:02:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in front of our parents.</font>

40
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What were you talking about just now?</font>

41
00:03:19,540 --> 00:03:20,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw everything.</font>

42
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What were you talking about?</font>

43
00:03:23,300 --> 00:03:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Outdoor bonfires are
all the rage in Yanjing.</font>

44
00:03:25,780 --> 00:03:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked if he wanted to go.</font>

45
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said he didn't.</font>

46
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did you ask me?</font>

47
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, do you want to go or not?</font>

48
00:03:53,640 --> 00:03:54,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Add some salt.</font>

49
00:04:08,060 --> 00:04:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it good?</font>

50
00:04:09,820 --> 00:04:10,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Delicious.</font>

51
00:04:11,220 --> 00:04:13,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it feels like something's missing.</font>

52
00:04:14,900 --> 00:04:15,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

53
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, it's missing us.</font>

54
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:17,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

55
00:04:17,980 --> 00:04:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

56
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:19,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

57
00:04:20,380 --> 00:04:21,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what I thought.</font>

58
00:04:21,660 --> 00:04:22,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With such a beautiful view,</font>

59
00:04:22,980 --> 00:04:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could you be missing?</font>

60
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I asked the guards
at Prince Duan's Mansion.</font>

61
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:27,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They said you were here,</font>

62
00:04:27,660 --> 00:04:28,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I rushed right over.</font>

63
00:04:28,940 --> 00:04:30,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If Jiang Yufan hadn't dragged his feet,</font>

64
00:04:30,820 --> 00:04:31,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd have been here ages ago.</font>

65
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:33,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Oh, go away.</font>

66
00:04:36,620 --> 00:04:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

67
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:39,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you like to eat?</font>

68
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can grill it for you.</font>

69
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No...</font>

70
00:04:41,660 --> 00:04:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

71
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm an expert</font>

72
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at grilling meat.</font>

73
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch how it's done.</font>

74
00:04:57,620 --> 00:04:58,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it sweet?</font>

75
00:05:04,180 --> 00:05:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

76
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying!</font>

77
00:05:06,860 --> 00:05:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you stoke the fire a bit?</font>

78
00:05:08,220 --> 00:05:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The fire's dying.</font>

79
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright, leave it to me.</font>

80
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First time seeing you smile like that.</font>

81
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so beautiful.</font>

82
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:28,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, are you completely clueless?</font>

83
00:05:30,280 --> 00:05:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look.</font>

84
00:05:32,280 --> 00:05:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is this even edible now?</font>

85
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:33,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's burnt.</font>

86
00:05:34,380 --> 00:05:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You really are hopeless.</font>

87
00:05:37,960 --> 00:05:38,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

88
00:05:39,420 --> 00:05:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw some mushrooms
along the path earlier.</font>

89
00:05:41,540 --> 00:05:42,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go gather some.</font>

90
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:46,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need. I brought mushrooms.</font>

91
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you want some? I'll get them out.</font>

92
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:50,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince and I</font>

93
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:52,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will go find some clean branches.</font>

94
00:05:53,260 --> 00:05:53,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

95
00:05:54,420 --> 00:05:56,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've already built
the fire up quite high.</font>

96
00:05:57,380 --> 00:05:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then we'll take a walk nearby.</font>

97
00:05:58,620 --> 00:05:59,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All right?</font>

98
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look after my sister.</font>

99
00:06:04,140 --> 00:06:05,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, rest assured.</font>

100
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We'll be back very soon.</font>

101
00:06:08,020 --> 00:06:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave Ying in your care.</font>

102
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:13,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

103
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:19,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grilling is all about heat control.</font>

104
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's too long, it will burn.</font>

105
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me give you a taste</font>

106
00:06:29,960 --> 00:06:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of authentic Jiang-style
grilled fish and meat.</font>

107
00:06:32,260 --> 00:06:33,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You won't be able to stop eating.</font>

108
00:06:35,940 --> 00:06:36,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is everyone?</font>

109
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:48,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

110
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

111
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't mean to disturb you.</font>

112
00:06:56,660 --> 00:06:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's these annoying bugs everywhere.</font>

113
00:06:59,780 --> 00:07:00,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been following me.</font>

114
00:07:01,820 --> 00:07:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Didn't Jun say</font>

115
00:07:02,980 --> 00:07:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you should take good care of me?</font>

116
00:07:04,740 --> 00:07:05,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I don't follow you,</font>

117
00:07:05,660 --> 00:07:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how can you look after me?</font>

118
00:07:06,980 --> 00:07:07,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang,</font>

119
00:07:08,460 --> 00:07:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just want to be alone right now.</font>

120
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time I see you,</font>

121
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there are so many people around you,</font>

122
00:07:14,780 --> 00:07:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you always seem so alone.</font>

123
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once in a while,</font>

124
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need someone like me</font>

125
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:21,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to pester you and liven things up.</font>

126
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, you barely seem alive.</font>

127
00:07:31,140 --> 00:07:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you can't stand these bugs,</font>

128
00:07:32,980 --> 00:07:34,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why insist on staying here?</font>

129
00:07:34,760 --> 00:07:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not just the bugs I can't stand.</font>

130
00:07:36,780 --> 00:07:38,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I especially detest the countryside.</font>

131
00:07:38,820 --> 00:07:41,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look, it's filthy and smells awful here.</font>

132
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And it's particularly dangerous too.</font>

133
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

134
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are here.</font>

135
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:48,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, none of that matters.</font>

136
00:07:49,180 --> 00:07:50,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as you're here,</font>

137
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even the countryside I hate most</font>

138
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">becomes a wonderful place.</font>

139
00:07:54,700 --> 00:07:56,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not as good as you think.</font>

140
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To me,</font>

141
00:07:59,300 --> 00:08:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whether you're good or not
isn't up to you.</font>

142
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be the judge of that.</font>

143
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may seem carefree,</font>

144
00:08:07,780 --> 00:08:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but still waters run deep.</font>

145
00:08:11,140 --> 00:08:12,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take that as a compliment.</font>

146
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The countryside has its charms too.</font>

147
00:08:17,940 --> 00:08:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait here a moment.</font>

148
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang, look.</font>

149
00:08:33,300 --> 00:08:34,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a beautiful butterfly!</font>

150
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, why did you let go?</font>

151
00:08:38,740 --> 00:08:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think</font>

152
00:08:40,100 --> 00:08:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's most beautiful</font>

153
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when flying freely in the sky?</font>

154
00:08:50,700 --> 00:08:51,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move.</font>

155
00:08:58,140 --> 00:09:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

156
00:09:01,010 --> 00:09:02,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

157
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

158
00:09:04,900 --> 00:09:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

159
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you ever fall into the water,</font>

160
00:09:06,940 --> 00:09:08,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will surely save you first.</font>

161
00:09:09,700 --> 00:09:10,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Stirring the heartstrings♪</font>

162
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

163
00:09:15,270 --> 00:09:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

164
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:24,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

165
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

166
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:31,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They shouldn't be able to see us now.</font>

167
00:09:33,260 --> 00:09:34,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They can't see us now.</font>

168
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪On my fingertip♪</font>

169
00:09:36,930 --> 00:09:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

170
00:09:40,980 --> 00:09:45,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

171
00:09:45,520 --> 00:09:48,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

172
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:53,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

173
00:09:54,170 --> 00:09:57,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>

174
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:00,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I only wish to see you more than once♪</font>

175
00:10:01,900 --> 00:10:02,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

176
00:10:02,820 --> 00:10:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You all just left earlier</font>

177
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and missed my Jiang-style grilled meat.</font>

178
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:06,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

179
00:10:06,640 --> 00:10:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That was a sinful waste
of a divine gift.</font>

180
00:10:10,680 --> 00:10:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me add some more chili for you.</font>

181
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

182
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you planning to hog it all?</font>

183
00:10:15,900 --> 00:10:16,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I brought the meat.</font>

184
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:18,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I'm the one who grilled it all.</font>

185
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine. You brought it, right?</font>

186
00:10:21,180 --> 00:10:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can eat the rest of the meat</font>

187
00:10:21,780 --> 00:10:22,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all by yourself.</font>

188
00:10:23,220 --> 00:10:24,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You think I can't do it?</font>

189
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:26,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dun.</font>

190
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dun.</font>

191
00:10:28,500 --> 00:10:29,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What Dun?</font>

192
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's that?</font>

193
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I almost forgot.</font>

194
00:10:33,340 --> 00:10:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince's childhood name is Dun.</font>

195
00:10:37,560 --> 00:10:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder he loves meat so much.</font>

196
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dun.</font>

197
00:10:41,020 --> 00:10:43,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would a grown man be called Dun?</font>

198
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:44,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because he was chubby.</font>

199
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:46,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chubby.</font>

200
00:10:47,820 --> 00:10:49,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, the Prince used to be a plump one.</font>

201
00:10:50,420 --> 00:10:51,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never would have guessed.</font>

202
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What would the ruthless Prince look like</font>

203
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:53,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when he was chubby?</font>

204
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:54,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He must have been adorable.</font>

205
00:11:03,020 --> 00:11:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Back then,</font>

206
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was just a plump little boy.</font>

207
00:11:06,700 --> 00:11:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eat up, have some more meat.</font>

208
00:11:07,580 --> 00:11:08,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chubby.</font>

209
00:11:09,560 --> 00:11:10,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A shooting star!</font>

210
00:11:10,740 --> 00:11:11,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick.</font>

211
00:11:11,860 --> 00:11:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Make a wish.</font>

212
00:11:13,700 --> 00:11:14,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A real shooting star.</font>

213
00:11:18,580 --> 00:11:19,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, make a wish.</font>

214
00:11:30,920 --> 00:11:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why aren't you making a wish?</font>

215
00:11:37,780 --> 00:11:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because my wish has come true.</font>

216
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:41,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you?</font>

217
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:43,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

218
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope the wishes the three of them made</font>

219
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:48,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all come true.</font>

220
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying,
did you leave something here?</font>

221
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:04,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't remember it.</font>

222
00:12:05,340 --> 00:12:06,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not fooling me, are you?</font>

223
00:12:06,900 --> 00:12:07,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

224
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:08,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This man is no good.</font>

225
00:12:09,780 --> 00:12:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know you can't bear to part with me.</font>

226
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:12,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I must marry someday.</font>

227
00:12:13,260 --> 00:12:13,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come back here.</font>

228
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I won't agree to it.</font>

229
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am your elder brother.</font>

230
00:12:17,220 --> 00:12:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you show some restraint?</font>

231
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:19,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me.</font>

232
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:29,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to have a word with you alone.</font>

233
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:42,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I plan to return to resume teaching</font>

234
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:45,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in Guanzhou in a few days.</font>

235
00:12:46,880 --> 00:12:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That sounds good.</font>

236
00:12:48,660 --> 00:12:49,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not spread the word about this.</font>

237
00:12:50,180 --> 00:12:51,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear Wei will be unwilling.</font>

238
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll leave Wei in your care for now.</font>

239
00:12:54,480 --> 00:12:56,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she suffers
the slightest grievance here,</font>

240
00:12:56,660 --> 00:12:57,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will not let you off.</font>

241
00:12:57,900 --> 00:12:58,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For now?</font>

242
00:12:59,460 --> 00:13:00,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's that supposed to mean?</font>

243
00:13:01,920 --> 00:13:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who knows when you might just drop dead?</font>

244
00:13:05,500 --> 00:13:06,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you really must leave,</font>

245
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:09,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't just vanish without a word.</font>

246
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear Wei would be heartbroken.</font>

247
00:13:14,380 --> 00:13:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you're leaving?</font>

248
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:17,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you're leaving?</font>

249
00:13:17,540 --> 00:13:18,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you going?</font>

250
00:13:19,060 --> 00:13:19,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

251
00:13:20,420 --> 00:13:22,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guanzhou is where we grew up.</font>

252
00:13:22,580 --> 00:13:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to go back
and become a teacher there.</font>

253
00:13:24,780 --> 00:13:25,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can come back to see me anytime.</font>

254
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't care.</font>

255
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guanzhou is so far from Yanjing.</font>

256
00:13:29,740 --> 00:13:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to be parted from you.</font>

257
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:32,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Neither do I.</font>

258
00:13:33,380 --> 00:13:34,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then would you be willing</font>

259
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to leave with me?</font>

260
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would.</font>

261
00:13:36,980 --> 00:13:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop meddling.</font>

262
00:13:38,580 --> 00:13:39,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Teaching is a fine profession.</font>

263
00:13:40,540 --> 00:13:41,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show some restraint.</font>

264
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

265
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:43,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you willing to stay</font>

266
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or go with me?</font>

267
00:13:57,420 --> 00:13:58,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are each other's only family left.</font>

268
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should support each other's choices.</font>

269
00:14:07,740 --> 00:14:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to stay.</font>

270
00:14:13,460 --> 00:14:14,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he wants to leave, let him go.</font>

271
00:14:15,440 --> 00:14:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once he's gone,</font>

272
00:14:16,860 --> 00:14:17,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll be mine alone.</font>

273
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sister.</font>

274
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's me?</font>

275
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:40,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's be frank with each other.</font>

276
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to be your sister-in-law.</font>

277
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't be serious.</font>

278
00:14:46,400 --> 00:14:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

279
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've thought it through completely.</font>

280
00:14:50,720 --> 00:14:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't have to marry my brother</font>

281
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for us to become family.</font>

282
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:55,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

283
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my marrying your brother
works just as well.</font>

284
00:14:58,920 --> 00:15:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We must cement our bond with kinship.</font>

285
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:04,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, calm down.</font>

286
00:15:04,680 --> 00:15:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relationships don't work that way.</font>

287
00:15:06,800 --> 00:15:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even without a marriage tie,</font>

288
00:15:08,960 --> 00:15:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll always be my dearest friend.</font>

289
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I know that.</font>

290
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

291
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you still remember</font>

292
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:18,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the one about destiny</font>

293
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I told you</font>

294
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before?</font>

295
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:23,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That gentleman in white?</font>

296
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I remember.</font>

297
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well...</font>

298
00:15:26,240 --> 00:15:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As it turned out...</font>

299
00:15:31,840 --> 00:15:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That person is my brother?</font>

300
00:15:36,200 --> 00:15:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a coincidence.</font>

301
00:15:38,140 --> 00:15:39,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good thing you didn't fall</font>

302
00:15:39,300 --> 00:15:40,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for Jiang Yufan.</font>

303
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Otherwise, think about it.</font>

304
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You'd have become my sister-in-law.</font>

305
00:15:46,080 --> 00:15:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I'd have become yours.</font>

306
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That would be far too messy.</font>

307
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is quite messy.</font>

308
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet, you like my brother,</font>

309
00:15:58,340 --> 00:16:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he seems indifferent to you.</font>

310
00:16:01,880 --> 00:16:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I came to ask for your help.</font>

311
00:16:05,200 --> 00:16:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, help me come up with a plan.</font>

312
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't want your brother
to leave either.</font>

313
00:16:09,640 --> 00:16:11,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, let's join forces</font>

314
00:16:11,340 --> 00:16:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make him stay.</font>

315
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:13,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you say?</font>

316
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:16,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You do have a point.</font>

317
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

318
00:16:17,920 --> 00:16:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what do you need me to do?</font>

319
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of girl
does your brother like?</font>

320
00:16:25,720 --> 00:16:27,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure he's a prince of Xizhao?</font>

321
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then, in your opinion,</font>

322
00:16:31,720 --> 00:16:32,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how should this matter be handled?</font>

323
00:16:33,680 --> 00:16:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

324
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:36,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you heard of the Chengtian Sect?</font>

325
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:37,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect</font>

326
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is a folk faith of Xizhao,</font>

327
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">recognized and supported
by Xizhao's imperial family.</font>

328
00:16:42,680 --> 00:16:43,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is inseparable from state power</font>

329
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet remains beyond worldly affairs.</font>

330
00:16:46,640 --> 00:16:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

331
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why bring this up?</font>

332
00:16:49,200 --> 00:16:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Chengtian Sect has grown powerful
in recent years.</font>

333
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They seek to meddle in Xizhao politics</font>

334
00:16:55,060 --> 00:16:57,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and have followers within Beiyuan.</font>

335
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao people are fierce,</font>

336
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but because their imperial authority</font>

337
00:17:01,240 --> 00:17:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">clashes with their divine authority,</font>

338
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they cannot match us.</font>

339
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Emperor
has long been bedridden</font>

340
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and has no sons to succeed him.</font>

341
00:17:11,360 --> 00:17:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once he passes away,</font>

342
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the imperial authority will fall,</font>

343
00:17:14,140 --> 00:17:16,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and Chengtian Sect will unify Xizhao,</font>

344
00:17:16,260 --> 00:17:17,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">becoming a dominant power.</font>

345
00:17:17,740 --> 00:17:20,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It could then rival us.</font>

346
00:17:21,580 --> 00:17:22,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master, do you mean</font>

347
00:17:23,540 --> 00:17:24,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we should send a prince to Xizhao?</font>

348
00:17:25,220 --> 00:17:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In this way,</font>

349
00:17:26,220 --> 00:17:29,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we keep Xizhao divided and balanced</font>

350
00:17:29,540 --> 00:17:31,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and use them
to check Chengtian Sect's power,</font>

351
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">ensuring our people in Beiyuan</font>

352
